{
	"info": {
		"name": "FixFlow — Field Service Management API",
		"description": "REST API for a field service business: customers request repairs, admins review and assign technicians with schedule-conflict detection, technicians update job status and submit service reports, and customers pay invoices through **bKash** (sandbox).\n\n**Roles:** CUSTOMER · TECHNICIAN · ADMIN\n\n**Quick start**\n1. Set `baseUrl` (default `http://localhost:5000/api/v1`).\n2. Run the three requests in `0. Auth / Login as …` — tokens are saved automatically.\n3. Walk the `Demo flow` folder top to bottom to see the full lifecycle: request → approve → assign → en route → in progress → report (invoice) → bKash payment → feedback.\n\n**Response envelope**\n- Success: `{ success: true, message, data, meta? }`\n- Error: `{ success: false, message, errors: [{ path, message }] }`\n\n**bKash sandbox wallet** for the payment page: number `01770618575`, OTP `123456`, PIN `12121`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
